<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 555.06, up 2.09.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 282 to 235.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.05.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 17,498,955 compared with 17,001,380 on Monday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
